(1. Introduction) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 417.8899999999999864 Td
(Employment and unemployment indicators are among the most closely watched economic statistics, directly informing) Tj
T* (labour policy, social protection design, and macroeconomic management. In India, the primary source for these) Tj
T* (indicators is the Periodic Labour Force Survey \(PLFS\), supplemented by administrative data from EPFO, ESIC, NPS,) Tj
T* (and payroll-based estimates.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 357.8899999999999864 Td
(This course focuses on the estimation methodology for employment-unemployment indicators: how they are computed) Tj
T* (from survey data, how they are validated, and how they are interpreted in the Indian context. It also covers the) Tj
T* (internationally recommended definitions from ILO's Resolution on Statistics of Work, Employment and Labour) Tj
T* (Underutilisation \(2013 ICLS\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 13 Tf
14.9499999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
48. 285.8899999999999864 Td
(2. Key Concepts) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
54. 267.8899999999999864 Td
(2.1 ILO / ICLS 2013 Definitions) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
54. 252.8899999999999864 Td
(The 19th International Conference of Labour Statisticians \(ICLS, 2013\) redefined key concepts:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Employment**: Persons who, during the reference period, worked for at least one hour in exchange for pay or) Tj
T* (profit, or worked in a job regardless of any pay \(contributing family worker\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Unemployment**: Persons who: \(a\) are not in employment, \(b\) are available for employment, and \(c\) are seeking) Tj
T* (employment. All three conditions must be met simultaneously.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (**Labour underutilisation**: A broader concept covering unemployment + time-related underemployment + potential) Tj
T* (labour force \(discouraged workers\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
54. 112.8899999999999864 Td
