BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 624.8899999999999864 Td
(PLFS household survey data is supplemented and validated against administrative data:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 603.8899999999999864 Td
(**EPFO \(Employees' Provident Fund Organisation\)**: Monthly payroll data for organised-sector formal employment.) Tj
T* (EPFO net new subscribers is used as a high-frequency indicator of formal employment creation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 569.8899999999999864 Td
(**ESIC \(Employees' State Insurance Corporation\)**: Covers workers in establishments with 10+ employees in notified) Tj
T* (sectors. Net new ESIC registrations indicate formal employment trends.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 535.8899999999999864 Td
(**NPS \(National Pension System\)**: Subscriber data from PFRDA for government and private sector formal) Tj
T* (employees.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 501.8899999999999864 Td
(**Payroll-based employment estimates**: MoSPI compiles quarterly employment estimates for 8 key sectors using) Tj
T* (enterprise-level administrative data. This provides a supply-side \(employer\) perspective complementing the) Tj
T* (demand-side PLFS.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 454.8899999999999864 Td
(**CMIE \(Centre for Monitoring Indian Economy\)**: Consumer Pyramids Household Survey provides monthly labour) Tj
T* (market data; used for comparison and validation but not official estimates.) Tj
ET
