48. 390.8899999999999864 Td
(␀*␀*␀P␀i␀t␀f␀a␀l␀l␀ ␀1␀ ␀-␀ ␀C␀o␀m␀p␀a␀r␀i␀n␀g␀ ␀a␀c␀r␀o␀s␀s␀ ␀r␀e␀f␀e␀r␀e␀n␀c␀e␀ ␀p␀e␀r␀i␀o␀d␀s␀*␀*␀:␀ ␀L␀F␀P␀R␀ ␀b␀a␀s␀e␀d␀ ␀o␀n␀ ␀U␀P␀S␀ "`␀ ␀L␀F␀P␀R␀ ␀b␀a␀s␀e␀d␀ ␀o␀n␀ ␀C␀W␀S␀ "`␀ ␀L␀F␀P␀R␀ ␀b␀a␀s␀e␀d␀ ␀o␀n) Tj
T* (CDS. Always state the reference period clearly.) Tj
