(**Pitfall 4 - Urban vs. rural structural differences**: Urban labour markets are more formalised with higher WPR among) Tj
T* (educated youth; rural labour markets have higher agricultural self-employment. Conflating the two distorts policy) Tj
T* (conclusions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
48. 228.8899999999999864 Td
(**Pitfall 5 - CV-based reliability**: Sub-group estimates \(e.g., by state and industry simultaneously\) may have high CVs) Tj
T* (due to small cell sizes. Treat such estimates with caution and report standard errors alongside point estimates.) Tj
